<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <title>Design Log Methodology | Jay Framework</title>
    <meta name="description" content="The Jay Framework is built using the Design Log methodology — a rigorous, document-first approach to software architecture that keeps AI agents and human developers aligned.">
    <script type="application/jay-data" contract="./page.jay-contract"></script>
    <script type="application/jay-headfull" src="../../components/site-header/site-header" names="SiteHeader" contract="../../components/site-header/site-header.jay-contract"></script>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="https://static.wixstatic.com/shapes/c569b3_448c7c0df8024b2786885af2054a24a8.svg">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../../styles/theme.css" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <style>
      /* ── Shared ── */
      .section { padding: 96px 0; }
      .section-label {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 500;
        line-height: 16px;
        color: var(--color-primary);
        letter-spacing: 0.4em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }
      .text-muted { color: var(--color-text-muted); }
      .text-primary { color: var(--color-primary); }
      .text-center { text-align: center; }

      .glass-panel {
        background: rgba(10, 15, 30, 0.7);
        backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        border: 1px solid rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.1);
        transition: border-color 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
      }
      .glass-panel:hover {
        border-color: rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.3);
        box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.05);
      }

      /* ── Hero ── */
      .dl-hero {
        position: relative;
        padding: 96px 0; /* design-system: allow */
        padding-top: 160px; /* design-system: allow */
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .dl-hero-grid {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background-image:
          linear-gradient(rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.05) 1px, transparent 1px),
          linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.05) 1px, transparent 1px);
        background-size: 40px 40px;
        opacity: 0.3;
        z-index: 0;
      }
      .dl-hero-content {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        max-width: 800px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .dl-hero-badge {
        display: inline-block;
        background: rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.1);
        color: var(--color-primary);
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 500;
        padding: 4px 12px;
        border-radius: 9999px;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }
      @keyframes shimmer-pass {
        0%   { background-position: -150% center; }
        15%  { background-position: -150% center; }
        35%  { background-position:  150% center; }
        100% { background-position:  150% center; }
      }
      .dl-hero-headline {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 48px);
        line-height: 1.15;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      }
      .shimmer-wrap {
        position: relative;
        display: inline-block;
      }
      .dl-hero-headline .shimmer-base {
        color: var(--color-primary);
        text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(71, 214, 255, 0.5);
      }
      .dl-hero-headline .shimmer-shine {
        position: absolute;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        background: linear-gradient(
          105deg,
          transparent 35%,
          rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5) 46%,
          rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85) 50%,
          rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5) 54%,
          transparent 65%
        );
        background-size: 200% auto;
        background-repeat: no-repeat;
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        background-clip: text;
        color: transparent;
        animation: shimmer-pass 5s ease-in-out infinite;
      }
      .dl-hero-subtitle {
        font-size: 18px;
        line-height: 28px;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        max-width: 700px;
        margin: 32px auto 0;
      }
      .dl-hero-buttons {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 16px;
        margin-top: 32px;
      }
      .btn-primary {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        background: var(--color-primary-container);
        color: var(--color-on-primary-container);
        padding: 16px 32px;
        border: none;
        border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: 16px;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: box-shadow 0.3s, transform 0.2s;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .btn-primary:hover {
        box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.3);
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .btn-secondary {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.3);
        background: rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.05);
        color: var(--color-text);
        padding: 16px 32px;
        border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: 16px;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: background 0.3s;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .btn-secondary:hover {
        background: rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.1);
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      /* ── Intro Section ── */
      .intro-section { background: var(--color-surface); }
      .intro-layout {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 64px;
        align-items: start;
      }
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .intro-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      }
      .intro-cards {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 24px;
      }
      .intro-text h2 { margin-bottom: 24px; }
      .intro-text p {
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 26px;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }
      .intro-text p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
      .intro-highlight-box {
        padding: 32px;
        border-radius: var(--radius-2xl);
      }
      .intro-highlight-box h3 {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 20px;
        font-weight: 600;
        line-height: 28px;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
        color: var(--color-primary);
      }
      .intro-highlight-box p {
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 24px;
      }

      /* ── Transparency Section ── */
      .transparency-section { background: var(--color-surface-lowest); }
      .transparency-content {
        max-width: 800px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .transparency-content h2 { margin-bottom: 24px; }
      .transparency-content p {
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 26px;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }
      .transparency-content p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

      /* ── Footer ── */
      .site-footer {
        background: var(--color-surface-lowest);
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(60, 73, 78, 0.2);
        padding: 48px 0;
      }
      .footer-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: var(--space-gutter);
      }
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      }
      @media (min-width: 1024px) {
        .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 2fr; }
      }
      .footer-brand {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 24px;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: var(--color-primary);
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }
      .footer-copyright {
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 12px;
        line-height: 16px;
      }
      .footer-heading {
        color: var(--color-primary);
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.15em;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }
      .footer-links { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
      .footer-links a {
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 12px;
        transition: color 0.3s;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--color-secondary-dim); text-decoration: none; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="page-root">

    <jay:SiteHeader />

    <main>

      <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
      <!-- Hero                                        -->
      <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
      <section class="dl-hero">
        <div class="dl-hero-grid"></div>
        <div class="container">
          <div class="dl-hero-content">
            <span class="dl-hero-badge">METHODOLOGY</span>
            <h1 class="dl-hero-headline"><span class="shimmer-wrap"><span class="shimmer-base">Design Log Methodology</span><span class="shimmer-shine" aria-hidden="true">Design Log Methodology</span></span></h1>
            <p class="dl-hero-subtitle">Jay is built using the Design Log methodology — a rigorous, document-first approach to software architecture. Every significant feature is designed in writing before a single line of code is written.</p>
            <div class="dl-hero-buttons">
              <a class="btn-primary" href="/design-log/jay/index">Jay Framework Logs</a>
              <a class="btn-secondary" href="/design-log/wix/index">Wix Integration Logs</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
      <!-- What is the Design Log Methodology          -->
      <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
      <section class="section intro-section">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="intro-layout">
            <div class="intro-text">
              <span class="section-label">Overview</span>
              <h2 class="headline-lg" style="margin-top: 16px;">What is a Design Log?</h2>
              <p>A Design Log is a structured document that captures the full decision-making process for a feature or architectural change. It's not a spec, not a ticket, and not documentation — it's a living record of <strong style="color: var(--color-text);">why</strong> things are built the way they are.</p>
              <p>Unlike traditional design documents that become stale, design logs are written <strong style="color: var(--color-text);">before implementation begins</strong> and serve as the single source of truth throughout the development process. They capture the context, constraints, trade-offs, and decisions that code alone cannot convey.</p>
              <p>The methodology was born out of the need to give AI agents — and human developers — a reliable reference point. When multiple agents collaborate on a complex system, ambiguity is the enemy. The design log eliminates ambiguity by making intent explicit and verifiable.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="intro-cards">
              <div class="intro-highlight-box glass-panel">
                <h3>The Design Log is the Source of Truth</h3>
                <p>Any plan — whether provided by the user, generated during plan mode, or inferred by an AI agent — must be validated against the design log before implementation. If a plan deviates from the design log, the deviation must be flagged. The design log takes precedence over guesses, assumptions, or blind code searches.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="intro-highlight-box glass-panel">
                <h3>Required for Every Contribution</h3>
                <p>Every contribution to Jay — whether from a human developer or an AI agent — must follow the Design Log methodology. New features and architectural changes require a design log to be written and approved before implementation begins. No code is merged without it.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
      <!-- Transparency                                -->
      <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
      <section class="section transparency-section">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="transparency-content">
            <span class="section-label">Transparency</span>
            <h2 class="headline-lg" style="margin-top: 16px;">Open Design, Not Just Open Source</h2>
            <p>We believe open source frameworks should be transparent beyond the code. That means publishing not just what we built, but how we designed it — what we tried, what failed, and how the system evolved over time.</p>
            <p>Jay's design logs are a public record of every architectural decision, dead end, and trade-off. They show the reasoning behind the code, not just the result. If you want to understand why Jay works the way it does, the answer is always in the design log.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

    </main>

    <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
    <!-- Footer                                      -->
    <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
    <footer class="site-footer">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="footer-grid">
          <div>
            <div class="footer-brand">Jay Framework</div>
            <p class="footer-copyright">Built with Jay Stack. The self-correcting visual ecosystem for AI-native web development.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="footer-heading">Resources</h3>
            <ul class="footer-links">
              <li><a href="#">Documentation</a></li>
              <li><a href="#">GitHub</a></li>
              <li><a href="#">Community</a></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="footer-heading">Legal</h3>
            <ul class="footer-links">
              <li><a href="#">Security Policy</a></li>
              <li><a href="#">Privacy</a></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="footer-heading">Learn More</h3>
            <p class="footer-copyright">Jay bridges the gap between probabilistic AI outputs and deterministic engineering standards.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </footer>

    </div>
  </body>
</html>
